---
description: Conventions for adding or editing project specs
globs: _specs/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

- Specs live in `_specs/<kebab-case-name>.md`; start from `_templates/spec.md`.
- Front matter `status` is one of: draft, in-progress, shipped, archived.
- Front matter `tools` is a list containing claude-code and/or cursor.
- Dates use YYYY-MM-DD. On edits, set `updated` and append to the Changelog section.
